  "question": {
    "text": "The mean of a set of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn></math>&nbsp;observation is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>75</mn></math>. If each observations is multiplied by non-zero number <math><mi>&#955;</mi></math> and then each of them is decreased by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn></math>, their mean remains the same. Then, <math><mi>&#955;</mi></math> is equal to :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn></math>&nbsp;observations be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>30</mn></msub></math>.</p><p>Given mean&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>30</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>30</mn></math></p><p>Now according to question,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>30</mn></msub><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>75</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><mn>30</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>75</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>30</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
